#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid "<em>The 120ml tubes are incredibly generous for an intro set.</em>"
msgstr "<em>ຫຼອດຂະໜາດ 120ml ຖືວ່າໃຫ້ມາຫຼາຍເກີນຄຸ້ມສຳລັບຊຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.</em>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-800\"> This set features four stunning, signature colors. "
"Teal, Rust, Mustard, and Cream, inspired by our brand’s vibrant aesthetic.</"
"font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">ຊຸດນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍ 4 ໂທນສີເອກະລັກທີ່ສວຍງາມ: ຂຽວຫົວກິດ, ສີນ້ຳຕານສະໜິ"
"ມ, ສີເຫຼືອງມັດສະຕາດ ແລະ ສີຄຣີມ ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈຈາກເອກະລັກອັນສົດໃສຂອງແບຣນພວກເຮົາ.</"
"font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">Crafted from premium, sustainably sourced "
"beechwood, this easel combines elegant design with robust functionality, "
"making it an essential centerpiece for any artist's studio.</"
"font><br><br><strong><font class=\"text-black\">Key features:</font></strong>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">ຜະລິດຈາກໄມ້ບີຊຊັ້ນດີຈາກແຫຼ່ງຜະລິດທີ່ຍືນຍົງ, ຂາຕັ້ງແຕ້ມຮູບນີ້ຜະສົມຜະສານກາ"
"ນອອກແບບທີ່ສວຍງາມເຂົ້າກັບຄວາມແຂງແຮງທົນທານ, ເໝາະສຳລັບເປັນອຸປະກອນຫຼັກໃນຫ້ອງສະຕູດິໂອຂອງສິລະປິນທຸກຄົ"
"ນ.</font><br><br><strong><font class=\"text-black\">ຈຸດເດັ່ນສຳຄັນ:</font></"
"strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">Designed for aspiring artists and paper-folding "
"enthusiasts, this premium kit combines vibrant colors with intricate "
"patterns to make every creation a masterpiece.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບຜູ້ຮັກໃນງານສິລະປະ ແລະ ການພັບເຈ້ຍ, ຊຸດພຣີມຽມນີ້ລວມເ"
"ອົາສີສັນສົດໃສ ແລະ ລວດລາຍທີ່ປານີດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທຸກຜົນງານກາຍເປັນຜົນງານອັນໂດດເດັ່ນ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_31
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">This high-quality studio packshot showcases a "
"vibrant collection of arts and crafts supplies neatly arranged on a clean, "
"seamless white background.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">ພາບຖ່າຍສະຕູດິໂອຄຸນນະພາບສູງນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຊຸດອຸປະກອນສິລະປະ ແລະ ຫັດ"
"ຖະກຳທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ຈັດວາງຢ່າງເປັນລະບຽບເທິງພື້ນຫຼັງສີຂາວລຽບງາມ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_32
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">This premium collection is designed for artists who "
"demand precision, durability, and a sleek aesthetic.</"
"font><br><br><strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">What’s Inside:<br><br></"
"font></strong>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-800\">ຊຸດພຣີມຽມນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳລັບສິລະປິນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມປານີດ, ຄວາມທົນທາ"
"ນ ແລະ ຄວາມສວຍງາມທັນສະໄໝ.</font><br><br><strong><font class=\"text-o-color-5\">"
"ສິ່ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊຸດ:<br><br></font></strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_31
msgid "<font class=\"text-black\"><strong>What’s Inside:</strong></font><br>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-black\"><strong>ສິ່ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຊຸດ:</strong></font><br>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>60 Premium Sheets:</strong> </"
"font><font class=\"text-800\">A generous collection of square origami papers "
"featuring a wide variety of double-sided geometric designs.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ເຈ້ຍຄຸນນະພາບສູງ 60 ແຜ່ນ:</strong> </font>"
"<font class=\"text-800\">ເຈ້ຍໂອຣິກາມິສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ພ້ອມລວດລາຍເລຂາຄະນິດສອງໜ້າຫຼາກຫຼາຍແບ"
"ບ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_29
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Bonus Sticker Sheet:</strong> </"
"font><font class=\"text-800\">Add personality to your origami animals and "
"shapes with the included set of fun decorative stickers.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ສະຕິກເກີແຖມພິເສດ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ເພີ່ມລູກຫຼິ້ນໃຫ້ຮູບສັດ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງຕ່າງໆຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍສະຕິກເກີຕົກແຕ່ງສຸດໜ້າຮັກທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້"
"ໃນຊຸດ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Convenient tube packaging</strong> </"
"font>– Easy to squeeze, control, and store."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ຮູບແບບບັນຈຸຫຼອດທີ່ສະດວກ</strong> </font>– ບີບ"
"ງ່າຍ, ຄວບຄຸມປະລິມານໄດ້ດີ ແລະ ເກັບຮັກສາງ່າຍ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_31
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Craft Accessories:</strong> </"
"font><font class=\"text-800\">A playful assortment of small wooden figurines "
"including pandas, owls, and fruit slices (watermelon, orange), alongside "
"colorful scattered beads and star-shaped charms.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ອຸປະກອນຕົກແຕ່ງຫັດຖະກຳ:</strong> </font>"
"<font class=\"text-800\">ຕຸ໊ກກະຕາໄມ້ນ້ອຍໜ້າຮັກຫຼາຍແບບ ເຊັ່ນ: ໝີແພນດາ, ນົກເຄົ້າ ແລະ ໝາກໄມ້ "
"(ໝາກໂມ, ໝາກກ້ຽງ) ພ້ອມດ້ວຍລູກປັດຫຼາກສີ ແລະ ຈີ້ຮູບດາວ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_31
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Decorative Jars:</strong> </"
"font><font class=\"text-800\">Multiple small glass jars with classic cork "
"stoppers, filled with shimmering glitter in various colors (red, blue, "
"green, gold, purple) and tiny yellow beads.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ກວດແກ້ວຕົກແຕ່ງ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ກວດແກ້ວນ້ອຍພ້ອມຝາຈຸກໄມ້ຄອກ ບັນຈຸກາກເພັດຫຼາກສີ (ແດງ, ຟ້າ, ຂຽວ, ຄຳ, ມ່ວ"
"ງ) ແລະ ລູກປັດສີເຫຼືອງນ້ອຍໆ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_32
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Durable Build:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">Equipped with reinforced silver ferrules to prevent "
"shedding and ensure long-lasting performance.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ໂຄງສ້າງແຂງແຮງ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ປອກໂລຫະສີເງິນເສີມຄວາມແຂງແກ່ນ ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນຂົນແປງຫຼຸດລ່ວງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຍາວ"
"ນານ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Mix and match</strong> </font>– Blend "
"colors together to create custom shades and beautiful effects."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ປະສົມສີໄດ້ດັ່ງໃຈ</strong> </font>– ປະສົມສີເຂົ້າ"
"ກັນເພື່ອສ້າງໂທນສີໃໝ່ ແລະ ລູກຫຼິ້ນທີ່ສວຍງາມ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_31
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Paper &amp; Tools:</strong> </"
"font><font class=\"text-800\">A stack of beautifully patterned origami "
"papers featuring intricate floral and traditional designs, paired with a "
"pair of vintage-style ornate metal scissors.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ເຈ້ຍ &amp; ອຸປະກອນ:</strong> </font>"
"<font class=\"text-800\">ເຈ້ຍໂອຣິກາມິລວດລາຍດອກໄມ້ ແລະ ລາຍດັ້ງເດີມອັນສວຍງາມ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍມີດຕັດ"
"ໂລຫະລວດລາຍແບບວິນເທຈ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Smooth acrylic formula</strong> </"
"font>– Ideal for creating even coverage and expressive brushstrokes."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ສູດສີອາຄຣີລິກເນື້ອລະອຽດ</strong> </font>– ເໝ"
"າະສຳລັບການທາໃຫ້ລຽບນຽນ ແລະ ສ້າງຮອຍແປງທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Total Height:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">Adjustable from <strong>150 cm to 230 cm</"
"strong> depending on mast extension.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ຄວາມສູງລວມ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ປັບລະດັບໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ <strong>150 ຊມ ຫາ 230 ຊມ</strong> ຕາມການປັບແກນ"
"ກາງ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Type:</strong></font><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-5\"> </font><font class=\"text-800\">Classic Tripod A-"
"Frame Studio Easel.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ປະເພດ:</strong></font><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-5\"> </font><font class=\"text-800\">ຂາຕັ້ງແຕ້ມຮູບສະຕູດິໂອສາມຂ"
"າຊົງ A-Frame ແບບຄລາສສິກ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_30
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Ultra-Soft Texture:</strong> </"
"font>S<font class=\"text-800\">pun from premium fibers to ensure a smooth, "
"snag-free experience that is gentle on your hands and luxurious to the touch."
"</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ສຳຜັດນຸ່ມເປັນພິເສດ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ປັ່ນຈາກເສັ້ນໃຍຊັ້ນດີ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສຳຜັດທີ່ລຽບນຽນ, ບໍ່ຂັດມື, ອ່ອນໂຍນ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກ"
"ພຣີມຽມ.</font>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_28
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Versatile use</strong> </font>– "
"Suitable for canvas, paper, wood, crafts, and other suitable painting "
"surfaces."
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ</strong> </font>– ເໝາະສຳ"
"ລັບຜ້າໃບ, ເຈ້ຍ, ໄມ້, ງານຫັດຖະກຳ ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວງານແຕ້ມອື່ນໆ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:art_craft.product_template_27
msgid ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>Weight:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">Approximately <strong>6.5 kg</strong>, providing a sturdy "
"foundation while remaining portable within the studio.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<font class=\"text-o-color-3\"><strong>ນ້ຳໜັກ:</strong> </font><font "
"class=\"text-800\">ປະມານ <strong>6.5 ກິໂລກຣາມ</strong>, ຕັ້ງໄດ້ຢ່າງໝັ້ນຄົງ ແລະ ຍ້າຍໄດ້ສ"
"ະດວກພາຍໃນສະຕູດິໂອ.</font>"

