msgstr "<strong>ສະຖານທີ່:</strong> Arts-craft, Ramillies."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Location:</strong> indu-arts-craft-store, Ramillies."
msgstr "<strong>ສະຖານທີ່:</strong> indu-arts-craft-store, Ramillies."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>Pattern Reading:</strong> Learn how to decipher simple patterns so "
"you can continue your journey at home."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການອ່ານຜັງລາຍຖັກ:</strong> ຮຽນຮູ້ການອ່ານສັນຍະລັກ ແລະ ຜັງລາຍຖັກແບບງ່າຍ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາ"
"ມາດກັບໄປຖັກຕໍ່ເອງໄດ້ຢູ່ເຮືອນ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Results from one of our previous workshop:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຜົນງານຕົວຈິງຈາກຫ້ອງຮຽນຄັ້ງຜ່ານມາ:</strong>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<strong>See what our students created following this workshop:</strong>\n"
"                    <br>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເບິ່ງຜົນງານທີ່ຜູ້ຮຽນສ້າງສັນຂຶ້ນຈາກຫ້ອງຮຽນນີ້:</strong>\n"
"                    <br>"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Symmetry and Precision:</strong> Understand how geometric accuracy "
"leads to beautiful results"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄວາມສົມດຸນ ແລະ ຄວາມປານີດ:</strong> ເຂົ້າໃຈເຖິງຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳທາງເລຂາຄະນິດ ທີ່ຈະນຳໄປສູ່"
"ຜົນງານທີ່ສວຍງາມ"

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>The Basics of Folding:</strong> Learn the foundational folds—"
"mountain folds, valley folds, and reverse folds—that form the basis of all "
"origami."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ພື້ນຖານການພັບ:</strong> ຮຽນຮູ້ວິທີການພັບພື້ນຖານ—ການພັບສັນພູ, ການພັບຮ່ອມພູ ແລະ ການພັບກັບ"
"ດ້ານ—ເຊິ່ງເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳຄັນຂອງງານໂອຣິກາມິທັງໝົດ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Core Stitches:</strong> Master the essentials, including the "
"chain stitch, single crochet, and double crochet."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລາຍຖັກພື້ນຖານ:</strong> ຮຽນຮູ້ລາຍຖັກຫຼັກທີ່ສຳຄັນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຖັກໂສ້ (Chain), ຖັກຄວັກທຳມະ"
"ດາ (Single crochet), ແລະ ຖັກ 1 ຄັ້ງ (Double crochet)."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Day's Project:</strong> You’ll put your new skills to work "
"immediately by starting a stylish project (such as a modern coaster or a "
"cozy winter headband)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຊິ້ນງານປະຈຳວັນ:</strong> ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ນຳເອົາທັກສະໃໝ່ໄປໃຊ້ທັນທີ ໂດຍການເລີ່ມເຮັດຊິ້ນງານສຸດເ"
"ກ໋ (ເຊັ່ນ: ແຜ່ນຮອງຈອກຮ່ວມສະໄໝ ຫຼື ສາຍຄາດຫົວກັນໜາວ)."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_2
msgid ""
