"ງກັນ."

#. module: art_craft
#: model_terms:event.event,description:art_craft.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<strong>Traditional Models:</strong> We will guide you through creating "
"classic designs such as the iconic paper crane, elegant butterflies, and "
"seasonal flowers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຮູບແບບດັ້ງເດີມ:</strong> ພວກເຮົາຈະພາທ່ານພັບຮູບຊົງຄລາສສິກ ເຊັ່ນ: ນົກກະຮຽນເຈ້ຍ, ແມງກະ"
"ເບື້ອ ແລະ ດອກໄມ້ປະຈຳລະດູການ."

